    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About The Game</h2>DUCKS is a casual clicker game featuring cute ducks. Collect more ducks by playing, crafting and trading with other duck enthusiasts.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>- exchange system - you will be able to echange ducks from your Steam inventory into other ducks of varying rarity<br>- seasonal ducks - more ducks will be able to drop in the upcoming weeks and months<br>- trading with other players using the Steam Marketplace<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DUCKS</h2>- we are not using AI for any process in making the ducks<br>- all of the ducks are made us or our artist friends<br><br><i>Remember to take a good care of your ducks... or else...</i>",
